1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,133
before you were anyone

2
00:00:01,366 --> 00:00:03,266
you were a small light in the dark

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,466
nobody asked you

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,800
nobody warned you

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,200
one morning the world simply let you in

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,533
at first everything is enormous

7
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,733
a puddle is an ocean

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,333
a butterfly is a miracle

9
00:00:19,366 --> 00:00:21,600
you fall down 100 times a day

10
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,333
and every single time you get back up

11
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,866
no one has to teach you that

12
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,066
you just know

13
00:00:30,533 --> 00:00:31,700
then they hand you a pencil

14
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,133
a desk and a thousand questions

15
00:00:34,133 --> 00:00:35,500
you learn the answers

16
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:38,300
but the questions you care about most

17
00:00:38,933 --> 00:00:42,000
no one can answer who am I

18
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:42,866
where am I going

19
00:00:42,933 --> 00:00:44,100
does any of this matter

20
00:00:46,733 --> 00:00:49,066
and then one ordinary afternoon

21
00:00:49,366 --> 00:00:50,700
someone looks back at you

22
00:00:51,666 --> 00:00:53,266
your heart forgets how to behave

23
00:00:54,166 --> 00:00:56,066
you fall in love clumsy

24
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:57,800
fast and completely sure

25
00:00:58,866 --> 00:01:01,400
for a while the whole world is only two people wide

26
00:01:04,166 --> 00:01:06,533
then the world hands you a hard hat and a heavy load

27
00:01:07,466 --> 00:01:08,700
bills deadlines

28
00:01:09,133 --> 00:01:10,566
promises you have to keep

29
00:01:11,533 --> 00:01:12,866
the days get shorter

30
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:14,000
the worries get longer

31
00:01:14,966 --> 00:01:17,066
you fail you try again

32
00:01:17,133 --> 00:01:18,333
you fail a little better

33
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:21,600
some nights you sit in the rain and wonder

34
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,900
where your butterfly went

35
00:01:25,533 --> 00:01:28,200
andthen someone small reaches for your hand

36
00:01:29,533 --> 00:01:32,000
they look at the world the way you used to

37
00:01:32,866 --> 00:01:34,166
every puddle an ocean

38
00:01:34,366 --> 00:01:35,866
every butterfly a miracle

39
00:01:36,866 --> 00:01:38,533
and the weight feels lighter

40
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:40,900
because now you know what it was for

41
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:46,733
time slows down and somehow moves faster

42
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:49,066
the hat gets softer

43
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:50,366
the steps get shorter

44
00:01:51,466 --> 00:01:53,266
the people you love begin to leave

45
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:55,200
like lights rising into the sky

46
00:01:56,666 --> 00:01:58,666
you don't carry as much anymore

47
00:01:59,333 --> 00:02:00,533
you don't need to

48
00:02:01,466 --> 00:02:03,500
you sit where you once danced and watch

49
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:05,133
someone else chase the butterfly

50
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:10,500
in the end a life isn't measured in years

51
00:02:11,666 --> 00:02:13,466
it's measured in puddles and pencils

52
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:15,300
in hands held and loads carried

53
00:02:16,133 --> 00:02:18,333
in the moments you were truly there

54
00:02:19,933 --> 00:02:21,533
so close your eyes gently

55
00:02:23,566 --> 00:02:26,266
somewhere a small light is waking up

56
00:02:27,133 --> 00:02:29,500
and a new morning is just beginning

